  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Visibility of EU and Public Diplomacy in the Republic of Moldova 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective to which this action contributes is to support EU public diplomacy and increased visibility of the EU and the EU assistance provided to the Republic of Moldova, while providing targeted information on tangible results for the Moldovan citizens. The focus of the public diplomacy effort of this contract should be the EU values and assistance provided to the country, taking as reference the opened negotiations for Moldova to become part of EU. The project will be focused on ensuring communication support for the actions funded by the European Union and its Member States and what EU accession and alignment to EU &lt;em&gt;acquis&lt;/em&gt; means for Moldova and its citizens.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
